    "body": "Escalated effort:medium to effort:high before claiming. No code changed.\n\nUpstream main 1d3d935418e36e7618985c8cb9217657ece32cd1 has no crates/geometry/src/nesting/ subsystem. The existing crates/motion/src/plasma/nest.rs orders contours for one plasma profile; it does not place parts on sheets or carry job/group priorities.\n\nThe prerequisites named in this issue are still open. #2159 defines the global sheet containment tree and safety ordering. #2161 connects nested layouts to router sheet toolpaths and post verification. Implementing those here would exceed this issue's scope. Changing cut-order safety also meets the effort:high safety floor.\n\nNo pin, mutation check, or gate ran because the required sheet layout and cut-order APIs do not exist yet. No branch or worktree was created. No claim was taken; the issue remains unclaimed. Resume after the nesting prerequisites land, then pin early-sheet priority and safety-first ordering through their APIs.\n",
